### 1. Lion(아기사자) 등록 — 201 Created
POST http://localhost:8080/members/lions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "young",
  "major": "컴퓨터공학과",
  "generation": 13,
  "part": "백엔드",
  "studentId": "20230002"
}

### 2. Staff(운영진) 등록 — 201 Created
### 등록
POST http://localhost:8080/members/staffs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "minsu",
  "major": "소프트웨어학과",
  "generation": 13,
  "part": "백엔드",
  "position": "부대표"
}

### 3. 이름 중복 등록 — 409 Conflict (위 이영희를 또 등록)
POST http://localhost:8080/members/lions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "이영희",
  "major": "컴퓨터공학과",
  "generation": 13,
  "part": "백엔드",
  "studentId": "20230002"
}

### 4. 단일 멤버 조회 — 200 OK
GET http://localhost:8080/members/minsu

### 5. 없는 멤버 조회 — 404 Not Found
GET http://localhost:8080/members/없는이름

### 6. Lion 수정 — 200 OK
PUT http://localhost:8080/members/lions/young
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "major": "정보통신공학과",
  "generation": 13,
  "part": "프론트엔드",
  "studentId": "20230001"
}

### 7. Staff 수정 — 200 OK
PUT http://localhost:8080/members/staffs/박민수
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "major": "정보통신공학과",
  "generation": 13,
  "part": "프론트엔드",
  "position": "대표"
}

### 8. 멤버 삭제 — 204 No Content
DELETE http://localhost:8080/members/young

### 9. 없는 멤버 삭제 — 404 Not Found
DELETE http://localhost:8080/members/없는이름